do CameraManager.change_ots_cam("Player")
advanced_character: Why do you look exactly like me?
do CameraManager.change_ots_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
main_character: Why do YOU look exactly like me?
do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
advanced_character: You looked exactly like me first! It's up to you to explain!
do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("Player")
main_character: That doesn't even make any sense
do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
advanced_character: Well, I can't have an imposter going around
do CameraManager.change_ots_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
- I agree!
	main_character: You know what....
	I agree! DIE IMPOSTER!
	do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
	advanced_character: NO, YOU DIE!
	[signal arg="hostile"]
- Let's talk about this!
	Let's talk about this!
	main_character: Can't we just be friends?
	do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
	advanced_character: No! What if you pretend to be me and go around ruining my reputation?
	do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("Player")
	- Wouldn't I be ruining my own reputation too?
		main_character: Wouldn't I be ruining my own reputation too?
		do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
		advanced_character: You know what...
		advanced_character: That actually makes sense...
		do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("Player")
		main_character: Truce?
		do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
		advanced_character: Fine. Truce.
	- I think I could only improve it
		main_character: I think I could only improve it
		do CameraManager.change_selfie_cam("AdvancedCharacter")
		advanced_character: WHAT DID YOU SAY???
